  "notes": "ETYMOLOGY:\n{値|ね} (price, value) + {上|あ}げ (raising, from {上|あ}げる)\n\nFORMS:\n{値上|ねあ}げする - to raise prices (transitive suru-verb)\n{値上|ねあ}げされる - prices are raised (passive)\n\nCOMMON COLLOCATIONS:\n- {値上|ねあ}げを{発表|はっぴょう}する - to announce a price increase\n- {値上|ねあ}げに{踏|ふ}み{切|き}る - to decide on a price increase\n- {値上|ねあ}げ{幅|はば} - amount of price increase\n- {値上|ねあ}げラッシュ - wave of price increases\n\nUSAGE:\n- {物価|ぶっか}の{値上|ねあ}げ - price increases of goods\n- {賃金|ちんぎん}の{値上|ねあ}げ - wage increase\n- {家賃|やちん}の{値上|ねあ}げ - rent increase\n\nSIMILAR WORDS:\n- {値下|ねさ}げ - price reduction",
